- Project Description:
This Project demonstrates How the Cache system will adapt different Eviction Stratgies based on the user's Behaviour to make the system more efficient and faster.


-- Project WorkFlow
Main.java: 
    This is the main root file of the entire project. It's main purpose is to initialize the cache and adaptive_engine_policy object.
    It is used to put, get and different values for the cache object.

Cache.java
    Here the object was initialized by the Main.java by passing 2 parameters 1. The cache size and 2. The eviction strategy object that is used by the cache system.
    In this File we have created multiple methods like put and get to access the data from the cache system. .....

EvictionStrategy.java
    This is the interface through which the Eviction Strategies like LRU and LFU are implemented.

LRUStrategy.java
    LRU Eviction Stragegy is built with the help of the Doubly Linked List. In this we create a map where the key and the Node is the key value pair. The Node which is recently used is either moved to the front or added to the front if it is not already present inside the map.